cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. It is a candidate formal statement, not a proof."
title: "ClayYM: a candidate Lean 4 statement of the Yang–Mills existence and mass gap problem, with compiled guards against fake models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rémondière"
    given-names: "Kévin"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2443-7166"
